    "extcon_consumer_binding_supported": true,
    "evidence": [
      "extcon-usb-gpio.c matches linux,extcon-usb-gpio and obtains optional vbus GPIO by consumer name",
      "gpiolib-of.c tries both foo-gpios and legacy foo-gpio names",
      "With only VBUS, extcon-usb-gpio sets ID to 1 and reports EXTCON_USB; it does not report host role",
